# Git push policy (Graphics House / beestoon-live)

After completing any implementation work (features, fixes, UI, i18n, config):

1. Commit with a clear message focused on why the change was made.
2. **Push to GitHub (`origin main`) without waiting for the user to ask.**
3. Do not push secrets (`.env`, credentials). Never force-push to `main`.
4. Only skip push if the user explicitly says not to push in that turn.

Repository: https://github.com/meklads/GH
